# pico8/demo: the attract mode's captioned demo, from the record; make pad-author regenerates
# pico8/demo.json (no aim budget). Frames and pacing: pico8/demo.txt.
from-record demo_record.hex
caption build a trading empire/across the stars
idle 300
label probe
caption probe the dark/to find new planets
idle 150
fold 118 307
idle 270
label colonize
caption colonize planets:/each one needs and makes goods
idle 150
colonise p32
idle 270
label slipway
caption link colonies with slipways/so goods can flow
idle 150
slipway p32 p55
idle 270
label year
caption end the year:/trade earns money and science
idle 150
year
idle 270
label tech
caption spend science on new tech
idle 150
research xenofoods
idle 270
label closing
caption slipways/press any button
idle 180
